    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Sometimes i just stand in the middle of the subway station during rush hour and it hits me... there are thousands of people brushing past me and if i just... stopped existing right here, nobody would even trip. it would just be another delay. it feels like i'm already a ghost.",
